Beat drafts land here before they reach a chapter log.

The PostToolUse hook (.claude/hooks/prose-lint.py) fires on any file whose name
ends in _draft.md and blocks the write on a Tier-A FAIL. Convention:

    <story>/scratchpad/ch<N>_beat<M>_draft.md

Drafts are gitignored — this file exists only so the directory ships with the
template and arrives in every scaffolded story.
